<title>CROATIA: Croatian February RPI flat mth/mth, 3.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian February RPI flat mth/mth, 3.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES    FEBRUARY   JANUARY     FEB '96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	  0.0	+1.0	  +0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year		   +3.7	+4.2	  +3.6</p>
<p>NOTES -- Retail prices rose 4 percent for the first two months of the year, compared to a year-ago period.</p>
<p>Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly inflation hit 38.7 percent. -- Davor Huic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
